# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout, on every OS.
# The zero-dependency format gate (scripts/check-format.ts) rejects CR, so a
# Windows checkout with autocrlf must NOT introduce CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit binary types (never touched by line-ending normalization).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
